@AddisEats.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5047

GET {{AddisEats.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5047

### Get the five-day weather forecast
GET {{baseUrl}}/WeatherForecast

### Create an order with the Day 59 correlation ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: Day59-correlation-id

{
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "items": [
    {
      "menuItemId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

### Get the created order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/1
